(5884081, 855243, 60173, '<td valign="top">There''s something very appealing about this, but I''m not sure exactly what makes it work so well. The exposure is well balanced throughout, and I really like the DOF.<br/> <br/>There''s some weird lines in the cloud. I can''t tell if they''re natural or not, but they look out of place. There''s a couple strong lines right above the center duck along with a couple other spots. I only noticed it after staring entirely too close at the screen though. From a distance I don''t really notice it.</td>', 'There''s something very appealing about this, but I''m not sure exactly what makes it work so well. The exposure is well balanced throughout, and I really like the DOF. There''s some weird lines in the cloud. I can''t tell if they''re natural or not, but they look out of place. There''s a couple strong lines right above the center duck along with a couple other spots. I only noticed it after staring entirely too close at the screen though. From a distance I don''t really notice it.', '2010-03-01 00:22:35.000000', NULL, 1),
