(5884660, 856961, 15711, '<td valign="top">I like the backlit wings and the stop action. :)</td>', 'I like the backlit wings and the stop action. :)', '2010-03-01 08:31:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5884662, 853768, 15711, '<td valign="top">I like the sign on the left - it kind of breaks up the sense of symmetry and creates an invisible diagonal line to the mountains.  I love the cloud in the upper left.  Great reflective qualities.</td>', 'I like the sign on the left - it kind of breaks up the sense of symmetry and creates an invisible diagonal line to the mountains.  I love the cloud in the upper left.  Great reflective qualities.', '2010-03-01 08:32:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5884663, 855919, 15711, '<td valign="top">Nataly lost her cutting board, so she just crawled up on the counter and pouted. (hee hee) I like it''s oddness.</td>', 'Nataly lost her cutting board, so she just crawled up on the counter and pouted. (hee hee) I like it''s oddness.', '2010-03-01 08:33:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5884664, 857054, 15711, '<td valign="top">I like the lackx of symmetry and the edit. :)</td>', 'I like the lackx of symmetry and the edit. :)', '2010-03-01 08:33:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5884665, 857219, 15711, '<td valign="top">I like the sense of the night but find the oversaturation of blue a bit overwhelming.</td>', 'I like the sense of the night but find the oversaturation of blue a bit overwhelming.', '2010-03-01 08:34:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5884668, 857038, 15711, '<td valign="top">Super sweet!! I love how the branches go from focused to blued.  Nice!! 7</td>', 'Super sweet!! I love how the branches go from focused to blued.  Nice!! 7', '2010-03-01 08:34:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5884669, 855904, 24666, '<td valign="top">This has the makings of a beautiful picture , all it needs is a little less work on the skin , the eyes , the mouth the blur are all spot on. I have scored a 9 could have been a 10.</td>', 'This has the makings of a beautiful picture , all it needs is a little less work on the skin , the eyes , the mouth the blur are all spot on. I have scored a 9 could have been a 10.', '2010-03-01 08:34:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5884670, 855786, 15711, '<td valign="top">I like the rich tonal varieties. What a great sky!!</td>', 'I like the rich tonal varieties. What a great sky!!', '2010-03-01 08:35:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5884671, 857146, 15711, '<td valign="top">You guys have gotten the snow this year haven''t you?  We got a little so the kids got a chance to play in it one day.  This is really pretty.  I like that you chose not to overdo the tones of blue.  The glow of the lights is nice.</td>', 'You guys have gotten the snow this year haven''t you?  We got a little so the kids got a chance to play in it one day.  This is really pretty.  I like that you chose not to overdo the tones of blue.  The glow of the lights is nice.', '2010-03-01 08:35:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5884672, 857653, 15711, '<td valign="top">Now THIS is terrific.  It has joy, movement, focus and a nice tonal range. 8</td>', 'Now THIS is terrific.  It has joy, movement, focus and a nice tonal range. 8', '2010-03-01 08:36:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5884673, 857523, 15711, '<td valign="top">The arc of his wings kind of blends into the rocks.  I bet this would be really cool if I could see it HUGE. :)</td>', 'The arc of his wings kind of blends into the rocks.  I bet this would be really cool if I could see it HUGE. :)', '2010-03-01 08:36:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5884675, 857083, 15711, '<td valign="top">You know what I like most about this?  It''s title.  When an image and its name come together, I really like that.  I love the criss-cross of the branches in the background.</td>', 'You know what I like most about this?  It''s title.  When an image and its name come together, I really like that.  I love the criss-cross of the branches in the background.', '2010-03-01 08:37:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5884678, 856500, 15711, '<td valign="top">I get rather tired of the drop pictures, but man, you have a quintuple drop series going on here.  This is really good.  Congrats on a job well done. The title is great too.  I''m one of those who will give an extra point when the title is clever and it adds to the overall appeal of the image.  The rich warm red is oh so nice.</td>', 'I get rather tired of the drop pictures, but man, you have a quintuple drop series going on here.  This is really good.  Congrats on a job well done. The title is great too.  I''m one of those who will give an extra point when the title is clever and it adds to the overall appeal of the image.  The rich warm red is oh so nice.', '2010-03-01 08:40:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5884679, 857532, 15711, '<td valign="top">hee hee - I love those little guys. :)</td>', 'hee hee - I love those little guys. :)', '2010-03-01 08:41:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5884680, 857457, 15711, '<td valign="top">Beautiful colors.  I like it when there are both the warm and cool palettes that come together.  Interesting perspective as well.</td>', 'Beautiful colors.  I like it when there are both the warm and cool palettes that come together.  Interesting perspective as well.', '2010-03-01 08:41:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5884682, 857235, 15711, '<td valign="top">Get a load of her eyelashes!!! Wow - you must have used some kinda zoom!!</td>', 'Get a load of her eyelashes!!! Wow - you must have used some kinda zoom!!', '2010-03-01 08:41:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5884684, 855005, 15711, '<td valign="top">This is so appealing to me.  The primeval forest.  Lovely indeed.</td>', 'This is so appealing to me.  The primeval forest.  Lovely indeed.', '2010-03-01 08:42:11.000000', NULL, 1),
