(5885138, 855423, 83313, '<td valign="top">Comes off looking quite flat, I''m afraid. Some common adjustments such as curves and contrast could fix that. The bigger problem that is hurting this, however, is JPEG compression. With a file size of 36k, this image is heavily compressed and has lost most of it''s clarity and detail from it. Always save at the largest file size you can that will fit into the challenge limit.</td>', 'Comes off looking quite flat, I''m afraid. Some common adjustments such as curves and contrast could fix that. The bigger problem that is hurting this, however, is JPEG compression. With a file size of 36k, this image is heavily compressed and has lost most of it''s clarity and detail from it. Always save at the largest file size you can that will fit into the challenge limit.', '2010-03-01 13:46:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5885147, 857199, 98022, '<td valign="top">Nice capture. Halo around the bird is a little distracting. (There is a good tutorial on how to eliminate the halos that is legal in advanced editing)</td>', 'Nice capture. Halo around the bird is a little distracting. (There is a good tutorial on how to eliminate the halos that is legal in advanced editing)', '2010-03-01 13:48:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5885152, 857382, 98022, '<td valign="top">Nice shot. Would be really good if the focus were better and the shadows opened up a bit.</td>', 'Nice shot. Would be really good if the focus were better and the shadows opened up a bit.', '2010-03-01 13:50:24.000000', NULL, 1),
