(5885254, 857562, 109227, '<td valign="top">I really like this one.  Nice job.</td>', 'I really like this one.  Nice job.', '2010-03-01 14:20:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5885259, 857097, 100393, '<td valign="top">I''m going through the entries, stopping at those images I feel have had the benefit of an unconventional eye and dwelling a little longer to try to see and appreciate what you saw. This is one of those images. <br/> <br/>Positives: Now this is what it''s all about! Love this. Perfect tones, the snow and the fog conspiring to give such wonderful stillness. I like how you verticals stat upright across the frame - did you lens-correct? Your POV is perfect too - offset to perfection.<br/> <br/>Critical stuff: I wonder how a tighter portrait composition may have been, cropped just medially to each of the gates - I suspect that may have increased the sense of depth because then the bridge would suggest extension behind as well as ahead.<br/> <br/>Overall: Flat out great image - immaculately presented.</td>', 'I''m going through the entries, stopping at those images I feel have had the benefit of an unconventional eye and dwelling a little longer to try to see and appreciate what you saw. This is one of those images.  Positives: Now this is what it''s all about! Love this. Perfect tones, the snow and the fog conspiring to give such wonderful stillness. I like how you verticals stat upright across the frame - did you lens-correct? Your POV is perfect too - offset to perfection. Critical stuff: I wonder how a tighter portrait composition may have been, cropped just medially to each of the gates - I suspect that may have increased the sense of depth because then the bridge would suggest extension behind as well as ahead. Overall: Flat out great image - immaculately presented.', '2010-03-01 14:22:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5885262, 856500, 100393, '<td valign="top">Wow - beautifully captured.</td>', 'Wow - beautifully captured.', '2010-03-01 14:24:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5885270, 855005, 96664, '<td valign="top">First ten in my books! Great shot!</td>', 'First ten in my books! Great shot!', '2010-03-01 14:27:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5885273, 857432, 100393, '<td valign="top">I''m going through the entries, stopping at those images I feel have had the benefit of an unconventional eye and dwelling a little longer to try to see and appreciate what you saw. This is one of those images. <br/> <br/>Positives: I think you have the exposure just right here and I''m not sure everybody would pull that off. I wonder if this is a pre-outtake for ''parallel lines'' - it would be a strong entry there.<br/> <br/>Critical stuff: The intrinsic interest level within the scene is a little limited which means that there is a ceiling on the interest you can convey in the image. Somehow it doesn''t feel completely sharp.<br/> <br/>Overall: A nice image that would do well in the right challenge but probably doesn''t have the level of interest to do well in the FS.</td>', 'I''m going through the entries, stopping at those images I feel have had the benefit of an unconventional eye and dwelling a little longer to try to see and appreciate what you saw. This is one of those images.  Positives: I think you have the exposure just right here and I''m not sure everybody would pull that off. I wonder if this is a pre-outtake for ''parallel lines'' - it would be a strong entry there. Critical stuff: The intrinsic interest level within the scene is a little limited which means that there is a ceiling on the interest you can convey in the image. Somehow it doesn''t feel completely sharp. Overall: A nice image that would do well in the right challenge but probably doesn''t have the level of interest to do well in the FS.', '2010-03-01 14:28:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5885282, 853642, 16829, '<td valign="top">Nicely done, but could have had more impact with her eyes open and without that one blurred flower stealing center stage.</td>', 'Nicely done, but could have had more impact with her eyes open and without that one blurred flower stealing center stage.', '2010-03-01 14:34:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5885289, 857224, 109227, '<td valign="top">Love the title.  Nice capture.</td>', 'Love the title.  Nice capture.', '2010-03-01 14:38:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5885297, 857280, 109227, '<td valign="top">Ouch.  Certainly captured the moment.</td>', 'Ouch.  Certainly captured the moment.', '2010-03-01 14:43:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5885301, 856739, 100393, '<td valign="top">I''m going through the entries, stopping at those images I feel have had the benefit of an unconventional eye and dwelling a little longer to try to see and appreciate what you saw. This is one of those images. <br/> <br/>Positives: Ursula - this is lovely, I have this image and the 1x version up on my screen while I type this and unusually I prefer this slightly smaller version - is it a bit sharper? I also prefer this image to your similar ''running water'' - this one seems to have more life somehow. I really love the colours here too, the bronze with the copper oxide green is wonderful<br/> <br/>Critical stuff: My eye is never drawn away from the wave on the left and I wonder how a square crop of the left side of the image might look.<br/> <br/>Overall: Quite lovely.</td>', 'I''m going through the entries, stopping at those images I feel have had the benefit of an unconventional eye and dwelling a little longer to try to see and appreciate what you saw. This is one of those images.  Positives: Ursula - this is lovely, I have this image and the 1x version up on my screen while I type this and unusually I prefer this slightly smaller version - is it a bit sharper? I also prefer this image to your similar ''running water'' - this one seems to have more life somehow. I really love the colours here too, the bronze with the copper oxide green is wonderful Critical stuff: My eye is never drawn away from the wave on the left and I wonder how a square crop of the left side of the image might look. Overall: Quite lovely.', '2010-03-01 14:44:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5885305, 854307, 109227, '<td valign="top">I like your depth of field here.  Nicely done.</td>', 'I like your depth of field here.  Nicely done.', '2010-03-01 14:45:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5885306, 857649, 109227, '<td valign="top">Perfect title.  Nicely done.</td>', 'Perfect title.  Nicely done.', '2010-03-01 14:45:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5885311, 856752, 100393, '<td valign="top">I''m going through the entries, stopping at those images I feel have had the benefit of an unconventional eye and dwelling a little longer to try to see and appreciate what you saw. This is one of those images. <br/> <br/>Positives: Great composition, placing the tree down there in the frame works brilliantly. I really love the stark snow too - I''m so glad you allowed this to be block white. It was also a good decision to hold onto the colour and not go monochrome.<br/> <br/>Critical stuff: The low levels of contrast in the upper part of the sky detract from a very powerful image. I can think of a bunch of ways to add a bit of drama to the upper part of the image - kinda wish you had.<br/> <br/>Overall: A very effective image, personally speaking the upper sky doesn''t do it for me but I like the image just the same!</td>', 'I''m going through the entries, stopping at those images I feel have had the benefit of an unconventional eye and dwelling a little longer to try to see and appreciate what you saw. This is one of those images.  Positives: Great composition, placing the tree down there in the frame works brilliantly. I really love the stark snow too - I''m so glad you allowed this to be block white. It was also a good decision to hold onto the colour and not go monochrome. Critical stuff: The low levels of contrast in the upper part of the sky detract from a very powerful image. I can think of a bunch of ways to add a bit of drama to the upper part of the image - kinda wish you had. Overall: A very effective image, personally speaking the upper sky doesn''t do it for me but I like the image just the same!', '2010-03-01 14:49:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5885314, 857476, 109227, '<td valign="top">Nicely done.</td>', 'Nicely done.', '2010-03-01 14:50:06.000000', NULL, 1),
