(5886324, 855535, 101668, '<td valign="top">great moment you caught here.</td>', 'great moment you caught here.', '2010-03-02 01:32:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5886329, 854606, 101668, '<td valign="top">I''ll watch this to see how you did it.</td>', 'I''ll watch this to see how you did it.', '2010-03-02 01:35:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(5886341, 857026, 34659, '<td valign="top">HAHA - Great capture!</td>', 'HAHA - Great capture!', '2010-03-02 01:50:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5886344, 855022, 34659, '<td valign="top">Teehee - Love the title.</td>', 'Teehee - Love the title.', '2010-03-02 01:52:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5886350, 856227, 34659, '<td valign="top">Must be Iceland!  Amazing location - and cool photo.  Perfect shutter speed.</td>', 'Must be Iceland!  Amazing location - and cool photo.  Perfect shutter speed.', '2010-03-02 01:59:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5886353, 855904, 34659, '<td valign="top">The white in the eyes is just a hair over the top, but the skin tones and detail are immaculate.  Those peach colored lips really balance the color scheme too.  I love the overall effect!  STUNNING!<br/>Had to come back and add this to my Faves.  Is this Manny?</td>', 'The white in the eyes is just a hair over the top, but the skin tones and detail are immaculate.  Those peach colored lips really balance the color scheme too.  I love the overall effect!  STUNNING!Had to come back and add this to my Faves.  Is this Manny?', '2010-03-02 02:03:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5886379, 855439, 66616, '<td valign="top">I really like this , excellent composition and exposure.</td>', 'I really like this , excellent composition and exposure.', '2010-03-02 03:18:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5886388, 857365, 113075, '<td valign="top">Having trouble finding the story , subject or focus here. makes it a rather boring shot. And if it is the pricetag on the chair it it not readable.....</td>', 'Having trouble finding the story , subject or focus here. makes it a rather boring shot. And if it is the pricetag on the chair it it not readable.....', '2010-03-02 03:41:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5886391, 852373, 113075, '<td valign="top">I think the border will kill you....</td>', 'I think the border will kill you....', '2010-03-02 03:43:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5886419, 857192, 7786, '<td valign="top">Glæsileg þessi Skarpi, gott ef þú nærð ekki bara þriðja borðanum í röð.</td>', 'Glæsileg þessi Skarpi, gott ef þú nærð ekki bara þriðja borðanum í röð.', '2010-03-02 05:15:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5886422, 857440, 7786, '<td valign="top">The image itself is stunning. Beautifully processed. The frame however brings its down. IMO a frame should be there to enhance focus on the image but not to drawn attention to itself. Without the blue line the frame would have been more descreet and possibly enhancing the image.</td>', 'The image itself is stunning. Beautifully processed. The frame however brings its down. IMO a frame should be there to enhance focus on the image but not to drawn attention to itself. Without the blue line the frame would have been more descreet and possibly enhancing the image.', '2010-03-02 05:25:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5886443, 857393, 94437, '<td valign="top">Good photo , but why is it blue ?</td>', 'Good photo , but why is it blue ?', '2010-03-02 05:56:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5886444, 855167, 93565, '<td valign="top">Lots of cool elements. Clouds are processed nicely, providing a dramatic element that is helped by the ice/glass sculptures and bridge. A lot of very cool structures and subjects going on in this one.</td>', 'Lots of cool elements. Clouds are processed nicely, providing a dramatic element that is helped by the ice/glass sculptures and bridge. A lot of very cool structures and subjects going on in this one.', '2010-03-02 06:00:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(5886445, 856287, 93565, '<td valign="top">The blown highlights in the snow really pulls the viewer away from your subject. Since this is advanced editing, I''d definitely consider selectively editing it and lowering the exposure.</td>', 'The blown highlights in the snow really pulls the viewer away from your subject. Since this is advanced editing, I''d definitely consider selectively editing it and lowering the exposure.', '2010-03-02 06:02:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(5886447, 856433, 93565, '<td valign="top">Pretty flat looking image, overall. Clouds are blown in places, and the composition directs the viewer right up the left side of the photo towards that.</td>', 'Pretty flat looking image, overall. Clouds are blown in places, and the composition directs the viewer right up the left side of the photo towards that.', '2010-03-02 06:05:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5886448, 852361, 93565, '<td valign="top">You really did do a great job of making her look like a classical sculpture. Great shot.</td>', 'You really did do a great job of making her look like a classical sculpture. Great shot.', '2010-03-02 06:05:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(5886449, 856386, 93565, '<td valign="top">Very pleasing minimalism. I''m loving this type of shot more and more these days. The isolation, quiet, and sterility of it are interesting.</td>', 'Very pleasing minimalism. I''m loving this type of shot more and more these days. The isolation, quiet, and sterility of it are interesting.', '2010-03-02 06:07:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5886451, 856777, 93565, '<td valign="top">Those branches on the left really pull the viewer away from the bridge/buildings.</td>', 'Those branches on the left really pull the viewer away from the bridge/buildings.', '2010-03-02 06:08:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5886452, 857382, 94437, '<td valign="top">Sorry but thats a bit blurry and hard to make out</td>', 'Sorry but thats a bit blurry and hard to make out', '2010-03-02 06:08:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5886455, 857562, 93565, '<td valign="top">I''m a fan of the variety of colors in this. In the depths of winter, summer can''t come soon enough, a dreamy remembrance. Your image is what I think of when I think of summer right now, and summers past. Nice shot.</td>', 'I''m a fan of the variety of colors in this. In the depths of winter, summer can''t come soon enough, a dreamy remembrance. Your image is what I think of when I think of summer right now, and summers past. Nice shot.', '2010-03-02 06:11:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5886460, 853642, 93565, '<td valign="top">I think this is a great shot, and I pretty much like everything about it except for that one blossom on her forehead.</td>', 'I think this is a great shot, and I pretty much like everything about it except for that one blossom on her forehead.', '2010-03-02 06:14:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5886461, 852004, 93565, '<td valign="top">Poignant, intense. The ambient lighting is great.</td>', 'Poignant, intense. The ambient lighting is great.', '2010-03-02 06:15:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5886462, 857054, 93565, '<td valign="top">Noise is an issue in your clouds. There''s also a pretty prominent spot right between them, about a quarter of the way down. Nice point of view though.</td>', 'Noise is an issue in your clouds. There''s also a pretty prominent spot right between them, about a quarter of the way down. Nice point of view though.', '2010-03-02 06:18:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5886463, 852327, 93565, '<td valign="top">Cool ice formations. It really makes one wonder what sort of scale I''m looking at. The variety of blues in this is nice too.</td>', 'Cool ice formations. It really makes one wonder what sort of scale I''m looking at. The variety of blues in this is nice too.', '2010-03-02 06:20:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5886469, 855439, 114472, '<td valign="top">Beautiful!</td>', 'Beautiful!', '2010-03-02 06:46:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5886471, 857021, 114472, '<td valign="top">Epic scene!</td>', 'Epic scene!', '2010-03-02 06:47:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5886491, 857141, 49109, '<td valign="top">could be the best pigeon shot I''ve ever seen. amazing clarity and detail</td>', 'could be the best pigeon shot I''ve ever seen. amazing clarity and detail', '2010-03-02 07:11:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5886492, 857474, 49109, '<td valign="top">great setup and lighting</td>', 'great setup and lighting', '2010-03-02 07:13:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5886493, 856884, 49109, '<td valign="top">neat crop and excellent bw-tones</td>', 'neat crop and excellent bw-tones', '2010-03-02 07:16:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(5886494, 857264, 100393, '<td valign="top">I''m going through the entries, stopping at those images I feel have had the benefit of an unconventional eye and dwelling a little longer to try to see and appreciate what you saw. This is one of those images. <br/> <br/>Positives: What a quirky image! There is loads of potential in this scene, a great set up!<br/> <br/>Negative stuff: What a shame! I think with a good edit this would be very nice indeed but at the moment it just cries out for some (software) attention.<br/> <br/>Overall: A disappointing image but not because of the photography but the way that it says ''sub-optimal'' so very loudly. Perhaps you don''t have access to the necessary software or simply prefer a ''straight-out-the-camera'' look but for me this is almost criminally under-edited.<br/> <br/>I''m revisiting this - all of the above sounds quite harsh now I read it back. I do want to emphasise that I really, really like the idea behind the shot.</td>', 'I''m going through the entries, stopping at those images I feel have had the benefit of an unconventional eye and dwelling a little longer to try to see and appreciate what you saw. This is one of those images.  Positives: What a quirky image! There is loads of potential in this scene, a great set up! Negative stuff: What a shame! I think with a good edit this would be very nice indeed but at the moment it just cries out for some (software) attention. Overall: A disappointing image but not because of the photography but the way that it says ''sub-optimal'' so very loudly. Perhaps you don''t have access to the necessary software or simply prefer a ''straight-out-the-camera'' look but for me this is almost criminally under-edited. I''m revisiting this - all of the above sounds quite harsh now I read it back. I do want to emphasise that I really, really like the idea behind the shot.', '2010-03-02 07:19:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5886504, 852361, 1232, '<td valign="top">10 :) Lovely art</td>', '10 :) Lovely art', '2010-03-02 07:43:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5886525, 857440, 1232, '<td valign="top">stunning</td>', 'stunning', '2010-03-02 08:12:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5886536, 857542, 30049, '<td valign="top">Not bad for a Tokina.  :-)</td>', 'Not bad for a Tokina.  :-)', '2010-03-02 08:15:48.000000', NULL, 1),
