(5886905, 857269, 81042, '<td valign="top">Stunning. Can''t wait to see the details of how you took the picture and processed it. Feels like a top 10 to me! Well done! 10</td>', 'Stunning. Can''t wait to see the details of how you took the picture and processed it. Feels like a top 10 to me! Well done! 10', '2010-03-02 13:57:53.000000', NULL, 1),
