(5887762, 855555, 83313, '<td valign="top">Ever since I used that title on one of my own entries, I''ve been noticing just how common a title it is.</td>', 'Ever since I used that title on one of my own entries, I''ve been noticing just how common a title it is.', '2010-03-03 00:53:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5887784, 856629, 114056, '<td valign="top">Excellent shot however i feel a few things have let you down here. I''m not sure what lens/camera combo you have, however it looks like you''ve got some colour fringing. The snow in the background has a ghost of itself, you may want to try a different aperture to see if you can make that go away.<br/> <br/>It looks like you''ve got some motion blur, perhaps try a tripod or a faster shutter.<br/> <br/>Hope this doesn''t come off sounding too negative, because it is a very nice shot.</td>', 'Excellent shot however i feel a few things have let you down here. I''m not sure what lens/camera combo you have, however it looks like you''ve got some colour fringing. The snow in the background has a ghost of itself, you may want to try a different aperture to see if you can make that go away. It looks like you''ve got some motion blur, perhaps try a tripod or a faster shutter. Hope this doesn''t come off sounding too negative, because it is a very nice shot.', '2010-03-03 01:00:20.000000', NULL, 1),
