(5887883, 853743, 93565, '<td valign="top">I''m normally not a fan of baby pictures, and have voted them down because I get so sick of them. This isn''t the case for yours, however, and I really like this one. Great expression, and the pose is a little bit different from a lot that I see. Nice B/W too.</td>', 'I''m normally not a fan of baby pictures, and have voted them down because I get so sick of them. This isn''t the case for yours, however, and I really like this one. Great expression, and the pose is a little bit different from a lot that I see. Nice B/W too.', '2010-03-03 02:27:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5887887, 857471, 93565, '<td valign="top">I don''t really understand the addition of the hand/arm, but beyond that, some off camera lighting could have really made this shot amazing.</td>', 'I don''t really understand the addition of the hand/arm, but beyond that, some off camera lighting could have really made this shot amazing.', '2010-03-03 02:29:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5887889, 856917, 93565, '<td valign="top">I like the composition- you''ve made the edifice sufficiently imposing, but I also like the way the building is so symmetrical, treats itself well to the centered comp. Nice choice on the vignette too.</td>', 'I like the composition- you''ve made the edifice sufficiently imposing, but I also like the way the building is so symmetrical, treats itself well to the centered comp. Nice choice on the vignette too.', '2010-03-03 02:31:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5887892, 855464, 93565, '<td valign="top">Very nicely lit floral photo. It doesn''t separate itself out from the rest of the FS photos particularly, but you''ve surely done a great job with the flower.</td>', 'Very nicely lit floral photo. It doesn''t separate itself out from the rest of the FS photos particularly, but you''ve surely done a great job with the flower.', '2010-03-03 02:32:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5887895, 856243, 93565, '<td valign="top">Ha, I knew I recognized that building when it first popped up. I''m assuming this is tonemapped/topazzed/HDR of some sort, and you''ve done a good job with things except it''s a bit brighter on the center pillars, I''d dodge that a bit to even it out and then brighten all of it, and center things because that slight tilt sorta bugs me.</td>', 'Ha, I knew I recognized that building when it first popped up. I''m assuming this is tonemapped/topazzed/HDR of some sort, and you''ve done a good job with things except it''s a bit brighter on the center pillars, I''d dodge that a bit to even it out and then brighten all of it, and center things because that slight tilt sorta bugs me.', '2010-03-03 02:35:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(5887899, 857669, 35545, '<td valign="top">Good action shot.  Too bad the background is so busy -- hard to see the rider''s profile.</td>', 'Good action shot.  Too bad the background is so busy -- hard to see the rider''s profile.', '2010-03-03 02:37:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5887900, 857447, 93565, '<td valign="top">Great portrait- the way you''ve captured things meshes perfectly with what I think would be fitting for this subject.</td>', 'Great portrait- the way you''ve captured things meshes perfectly with what I think would be fitting for this subject.', '2010-03-03 02:37:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5887902, 857229, 35545, '<td valign="top">Needs more contrast.</td>', 'Needs more contrast.', '2010-03-03 02:39:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5887904, 857046, 35545, '<td valign="top">Too much processing.</td>', 'Too much processing.', '2010-03-03 02:39:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5887906, 857522, 93565, '<td valign="top">Exposure compensation should have been set down a few steps to keep the snow/clouds from blowing out on this. Also, for future reference, these types of shots make for great HDR and B/W potential.</td>', 'Exposure compensation should have been set down a few steps to keep the snow/clouds from blowing out on this. Also, for future reference, these types of shots make for great HDR and B/W potential.', '2010-03-03 02:41:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5887907, 856969, 35545, '<td valign="top">Needs to be sharper.</td>', 'Needs to be sharper.', '2010-03-03 02:43:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5887908, 856809, 35545, '<td valign="top">Tack sharp.  Nice work.</td>', 'Tack sharp.  Nice work.', '2010-03-03 02:45:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5887911, 855534, 35545, '<td valign="top">Cute kid, but I''m not crazy about the tilted perspective.</td>', 'Cute kid, but I''m not crazy about the tilted perspective.', '2010-03-03 02:50:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5887913, 857131, 35545, '<td valign="top">Beautiful landscape, but it''s weighed down by that heavy border.</td>', 'Beautiful landscape, but it''s weighed down by that heavy border.', '2010-03-03 02:51:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5887932, 856386, 104841, '<td valign="top">really nice simple bw, well done.</td>', 'really nice simple bw, well done.', '2010-03-03 03:16:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5887934, 857065, 104841, '<td valign="top">nice composition, the middle left of the show looks a bit messy. I am not a particular fan of the tinting you have used though.</td>', 'nice composition, the middle left of the show looks a bit messy. I am not a particular fan of the tinting you have used though.', '2010-03-03 03:19:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5887936, 855191, 104841, '<td valign="top">havent I seen this church a couple of challenges ago? The HDR look of the church is quite good, though it looks like your HDR software gave up the ghost around the tree branches and does not know what it should do. MIght have to go back and do the sky by hand.</td>', 'havent I seen this church a couple of challenges ago? The HDR look of the church is quite good, though it looks like your HDR software gave up the ghost around the tree branches and does not know what it should do. MIght have to go back and do the sky by hand.', '2010-03-03 03:25:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5887941, 856882, 104841, '<td valign="top">nice location you had found here. I would like to see this as a mono and after you have cloned out some of the twigs in the water.</td>', 'nice location you had found here. I would like to see this as a mono and after you have cloned out some of the twigs in the water.', '2010-03-03 03:28:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5887963, 857656, 104841, '<td valign="top">I really like what you were trying to do but I think that you have over cooked the yellow light for my taste.</td>', 'I really like what you were trying to do but I think that you have over cooked the yellow light for my taste.', '2010-03-03 04:00:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5888007, 856936, 104841, '<td valign="top">nice composition but I think you have overworked the eyes, they stand out unnaturally.</td>', 'nice composition but I think you have overworked the eyes, they stand out unnaturally.', '2010-03-03 05:22:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5888016, 856344, 109341, '<td valign="top">Good Luck.  No Vote.</td>', 'Good Luck.  No Vote.', '2010-03-03 05:41:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5888186, 856705, 104841, '<td valign="top">I really like your use of soft focus here. I think that you should posted a smaller by higher quality image that does not have so much jpg fragments.</td>', 'I really like your use of soft focus here. I think that you should posted a smaller by higher quality image that does not have so much jpg fragments.', '2010-03-03 08:41:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5888223, 853893, 65234, '<td valign="top">Looks rather lazily propped up.  And bored ;-)</td>', 'Looks rather lazily propped up.  And bored ;-)', '2010-03-03 09:07:18.000000', NULL, 1),
