(5889796, 854753, 104841, '<td valign="top">nice technique behind the shot but I don''t really know what the point of the shot is as so much of what my eye wants to see is only half in the frame.</td>', 'nice technique behind the shot but I don''t really know what the point of the shot is as so much of what my eye wants to see is only half in the frame.', '2010-03-04 04:58:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5889797, 857021, 104841, '<td valign="top">nice shot of a well know place, I really like the clouds. Are you using ND grads? The top of the rock cliff looks much darker then the rest I would have dodged it a touch.</td>', 'nice shot of a well know place, I really like the clouds. Are you using ND grads? The top of the rock cliff looks much darker then the rest I would have dodged it a touch.', '2010-03-04 05:02:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5889798, 852019, 104841, '<td valign="top">Nice long exposure. I would have cropped almost the bottom half off though as there is not much happening there.</td>', 'Nice long exposure. I would have cropped almost the bottom half off though as there is not much happening there.', '2010-03-04 05:05:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5889802, 855789, 104841, '<td valign="top">nice to see something different, dont know about the eyes closed though, maybe your model needed to be more relaxed as he shoulders look a little stiff.</td>', 'nice to see something different, dont know about the eyes closed though, maybe your model needed to be more relaxed as he shoulders look a little stiff.', '2010-03-04 05:09:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5889804, 856984, 104841, '<td valign="top">nice go at a poplar subject. I think that there is too much contrast in sky for this shot to work as in this shot it has burnt out.</td>', 'nice go at a poplar subject. I think that there is too much contrast in sky for this shot to work as in this shot it has burnt out.', '2010-03-04 05:13:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5889807, 857675, 104841, '<td valign="top">nice silky water. I think you should have taken this closer to the waterfall as the right of shot is rather bland and boring.</td>', 'nice silky water. I think you should have taken this closer to the waterfall as the right of shot is rather bland and boring.', '2010-03-04 05:14:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5889809, 855455, 104841, '<td valign="top">ahh its a duck attack. I have no idea how you found so many ducks but good work. I just wish all the closer ducks were in focus though.</td>', 'ahh its a duck attack. I have no idea how you found so many ducks but good work. I just wish all the closer ducks were in focus though.', '2010-03-04 05:16:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5889810, 856145, 104841, '<td valign="top">you have got some lovely colour coming off these ducks but I think getting down a little bit lower would have helped your shot.</td>', 'you have got some lovely colour coming off these ducks but I think getting down a little bit lower would have helped your shot.', '2010-03-04 05:17:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5889812, 856745, 104841, '<td valign="top">nice composition I might have moved a touch closer. I think you need some more contrast or blacks to this shot as it is rather grey. If its a HDR you might want to do the tone mapping again. Don''t forget to clean you lens, there is some much in the top of shot.</td>', 'nice composition I might have moved a touch closer. I think you need some more contrast or blacks to this shot as it is rather grey. If its a HDR you might want to do the tone mapping again. Don''t forget to clean you lens, there is some much in the top of shot.', '2010-03-04 05:20:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5889813, 855535, 104841, '<td valign="top">nice sunset. I think the symmetric effect you have gone for only works if everything is more or less in line, which is not the case here, I would have left the shot with the sun and boat.</td>', 'nice sunset. I think the symmetric effect you have gone for only works if everything is more or less in line, which is not the case here, I would have left the shot with the sun and boat.', '2010-03-04 05:24:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5889815, 857137, 104841, '<td valign="top">really nice low light shot, get closer to the boat though.</td>', 'really nice low light shot, get closer to the boat though.', '2010-03-04 05:25:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5889905, 857046, 92577, '<td valign="top">I like the feel of this  but if I had to ''nit-pic'' it would be to mention his goose-flesh in the shadow cast by her chin. Also the chest hair might be better shaved rather than regrowth. good luck</td>', 'I like the feel of this  but if I had to ''nit-pic'' it would be to mention his goose-flesh in the shadow cast by her chin. Also the chest hair might be better shaved rather than regrowth. good luck', '2010-03-04 07:25:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5889907, 857272, 92577, '<td valign="top">Basic ingredients are there. It could be made sharper, brighter and ''Zippier'' with a bit of post processing. Good luck</td>', 'Basic ingredients are there. It could be made sharper, brighter and ''Zippier'' with a bit of post processing. Good luck', '2010-03-04 07:28:40.000000', NULL, 1),
