(5891503, 857382, 83313, '<td valign="top">Sorry, but this is not coming off very well for me. Heavy backlighting, a very soft appearance, and and off looking splotchy pattern on the tree are the main issues. To be fair, birds are difficult subjects and I don''t have many good bird shots of my own.</td>', 'Sorry, but this is not coming off very well for me. Heavy backlighting, a very soft appearance, and and off looking splotchy pattern on the tree are the main issues. To be fair, birds are difficult subjects and I don''t have many good bird shots of my own.', '2010-03-05 12:56:51.000000', NULL, 1),
