(5892756, 855647, 30982, '<td valign="top">There''s a good tutorial here:  <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/tutorial.php?TUTORIAL_ID=26" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">//www.dpchallenge.com/tutorial.php?TUTORIAL_ID=26</a>  This tells you how to resize photos for submission here.  Note however that the size allowed now is 800 pixels on the long side and up to 300K in size.</td>', 'There''s a good tutorial here:  //www.dpchallenge.com/tutorial.php?TUTORIAL_ID=26  This tells you how to resize photos for submission here.  Note however that the size allowed now is 800 pixels on the long side and up to 300K in size.', '2010-03-06 21:30:31.000000', NULL, 1),
