(5893304, 857506, 28427, '<td valign="top">Can you tell me the difference with this <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=855782" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/1000-1999/1171/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_855782.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/1000-1999/1171/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_855782.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/1000-1999/1171/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_855782.jpg"/></a> photograph?<br/>There *must* be a difference since otherwise your entry wouldn''t have been validated and entering one and the same photograph in different challenges is not allowed.<br/>*I* can''t pinpoint the difference between both originals though.</td>', 'Can you tell me the difference with this  photograph?There *must* be a difference since otherwise your entry wouldn''t have been validated and entering one and the same photograph in different challenges is not allowed.*I* can''t pinpoint the difference between both originals though.', '2010-03-07 10:52:57.000000', NULL, 1),
