(5893312, 855314, 28427, '<td valign="top">In a way I compare this photograph with this <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=851955" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/1000-1999/1165/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_851955.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/1000-1999/1165/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_851955.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/1000-1999/1165/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_851955.jpg"/></a> one and I have to admit that I slightly prefer the B&amp;W version.  You''ve mastered the lighting very nicely though so I hand out a *8*</td>', 'In a way I compare this photograph with this  one and I have to admit that I slightly prefer the B&W version.  You''ve mastered the lighting very nicely though so I hand out a *8*', '2010-03-07 11:03:04.000000', NULL, 1),
