(5893666, 856705, 52500, '<td valign="top">Hi Jennifer!</td>', 'Hi Jennifer!', '2010-03-07 18:09:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(5893668, 856451, 104230, '<td valign="top">I like the shapes and patterns of the bench and the use of black and white. It feels like the bench is the main subject so to my eyes the right half of the picture is mainly a distraction, visually.  I think the image would be improved with much of the right side cropped.<br/>Later: this does not bother me now nearly as much as it did originally, perhaps just a slight crop to eliminate that tall tower!!  Bump ...</td>', 'I like the shapes and patterns of the bench and the use of black and white. It feels like the bench is the main subject so to my eyes the right half of the picture is mainly a distraction, visually.  I think the image would be improved with much of the right side cropped.Later: this does not bother me now nearly as much as it did originally, perhaps just a slight crop to eliminate that tall tower!!  Bump ...', '2010-03-07 18:10:15.000000', NULL, 1),
