(5894320, 855319, 28427, '<td valign="top">"Night" and day <br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=857798" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/110000-114999/113075/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_857798.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/110000-114999/113075/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_857798.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/110000-114999/113075/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_857798.jpg"/></a> <br/>This photograph lends itself perfectly for this kind of processing.<br/>I awaited at least a +5 as a final score for this entry.<br/></td>', '"Night" and day  This photograph lends itself perfectly for this kind of processing.I awaited at least a +5 as a final score for this entry.', '2010-03-08 02:04:43.000000', NULL, 0),
