(5894965, 857542, 85334, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by glad2badad:</b></div><hr/><i> Wow.  I''m surprised this didn''t at least crack a 6! This was in my top 20 or so (gave it an 8).  It was funny when I first saw this in voting I recognized it from the eBay auction I had been watching.  Couldn''t figure out who it was from your eBay profile name so now I''m glad to know who took this wonderful photo.  Nicely done! </i></td></tr></table> <br/>Thanks. I think people used to the Zoo close-up shots of the animals do not appreciate how really fortunate I was to get this shot. Knowing how people vote on this site I really didn''t expect much though... I do these challenges just for myself, I don''t really care about the score too much. I appreciate the kind words and critiques though.<br/>I too see the same people from here on other sites from time to time... :) I think I''ve seen you on dyxum.com. I don''t think I''ll be visiting that site too much now, since I don''t have any Minolta/Sony stuff anymore... :)</td>', 'Originally posted by glad2badad: Wow.  I''m surprised this didn''t at least crack a 6! This was in my top 20 or so (gave it an 8).  It was funny when I first saw this in voting I recognized it from the eBay auction I had been watching.  Couldn''t figure out who it was from your eBay profile name so now I''m glad to know who took this wonderful photo.  Nicely done!  Thanks. I think people used to the Zoo close-up shots of the animals do not appreciate how really fortunate I was to get this shot. Knowing how people vote on this site I really didn''t expect much though... I do these challenges just for myself, I don''t really care about the score too much. I appreciate the kind words and critiques though.I too see the same people from here on other sites from time to time... :) I think I''ve seen you on dyxum.com. I don''t think I''ll be visiting that site too much now, since I don''t have any Minolta/Sony stuff anymore... :)', '2010-03-08 13:57:41.000000', NULL, 0),
