(5895199, 857264, 18799, '<td valign="top">Hi, Critique Club here...<br/> <br/>I think this is a great idea!<br/> <br/>There are a few things that I think might be improved on.<br/>1) It lacks a bit of contrast, maybe from compression.<br/>2) There is parallax distortion because you weren''t centered when you took the photo.<br/>3) Would have been nice to crop it tighter to eliminate the walls and such.<br/>4) I think the dog is cropped too tight.  I would have liked to have seen more of him, ideally facing the picture so it looks like he is really looking at it.  I realize that what we want and what the dog wants are usually different though ;)  I think the red collar is distracting and the picture would have been better without it.<br/> <br/>I would definately like to see you work this concept a bit more.<br/> <br/>These are just one person''s opinions so take it as that.</td>', 'Hi, Critique Club here... I think this is a great idea! There are a few things that I think might be improved on.1) It lacks a bit of contrast, maybe from compression.2) There is parallax distortion because you weren''t centered when you took the photo.3) Would have been nice to crop it tighter to eliminate the walls and such.4) I think the dog is cropped too tight.  I would have liked to have seen more of him, ideally facing the picture so it looks like he is really looking at it.  I realize that what we want and what the dog wants are usually different though ;)  I think the red collar is distracting and the picture would have been better without it. I would definately like to see you work this concept a bit more. These are just one person''s opinions so take it as that.', '2010-03-08 16:31:49.000000', NULL, 0),
(5895203, 854431, 61315, '<td valign="top">I love your PP in this shot. It''s just gorgeous and suits the image perfectly. Very sweet image.</td>', 'I love your PP in this shot. It''s just gorgeous and suits the image perfectly. Very sweet image.', '2010-03-08 16:32:58.000000', NULL, 0),
(5895211, 856006, 18799, '<td valign="top">Hi, Critique Club here...<br/> <br/>This is easy because it''s so well done!  <br/> <br/>My only, and I mean only critique is the yellow whateveritis in the upper left.  Since this is advanced, I would have burned it in a bit because it''s pretty bright and commands attention.<br/> <br/>Congrats on a great job.<br/> <br/>The person who gave this a one should be shot!</td>', 'Hi, Critique Club here... This is easy because it''s so well done!   My only, and I mean only critique is the yellow whateveritis in the upper left.  Since this is advanced, I would have burned it in a bit because it''s pretty bright and commands attention. Congrats on a great job. The person who gave this a one should be shot!', '2010-03-08 16:36:11.000000', NULL, 0),
(5895220, 855167, 18799, '<td valign="top">Hi, Critique Club here...<br/> <br/>Wow, what are the odds?  I drew your other image as well.<br/> <br/>I have to say I like this one much more.  I think it has better depth and the sky/reflected sky are great.  Additionally it doesn''t have the lit diagonals on the left to distract the viewer. <br/> <br/>The only issue I have is not with the photo, but rather the subject.  It gets really busy as you look toward the end of it.  So much so that the viewer can''t appreciate the graceful lines of the artwork.<br/> <br/>Nice job!</td>', 'Hi, Critique Club here... Wow, what are the odds?  I drew your other image as well. I have to say I like this one much more.  I think it has better depth and the sky/reflected sky are great.  Additionally it doesn''t have the lit diagonals on the left to distract the viewer.  The only issue I have is not with the photo, but rather the subject.  It gets really busy as you look toward the end of it.  So much so that the viewer can''t appreciate the graceful lines of the artwork. Nice job!', '2010-03-08 16:42:35.000000', NULL, 0),
