(5895647, 856209, 554, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by nroute:</b></div><hr/><i> <table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by David Ey:</b></div><hr/><i> what a nice shotgun.....great photo </i></td></tr></table> <br/>Thank you for your comment.  I have been a fan since you wowed us with your Magical Curves photo </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Thank you Neil....what a pleasant surprise to have a personal comment from you.  I have a collection of firearms but I can''t quite determine what this is. <br/>(brand) I have a Browning citori O/U that is similar.  I really like the fine checkering detail of this piece , and the wonderful engraving.  You have presented it extremely well....my 10.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2010-03-08 21:04:54.</i></td>', 'Originally posted by nroute: Originally posted by David Ey: what a nice shotgun.....great photo  Thank you for your comment.  I have been a fan since you wowed us with your Magical Curves photo   Thank you Neil....what a pleasant surprise to have a personal comment from you.  I have a collection of firearms but I can''t quite determine what this is. (brand) I have a Browning citori O/U that is similar.  I really like the fine checkering detail of this piece , and the wonderful engraving.  You have presented it extremely well....my 10.', '2010-03-08 21:04:07.000000', '2010-03-08 21:04:54.000000', 0),
