(5896169, 852004, 102398, '<td valign="top">I am really taken back by all the lovely comments I have recieved, I was just delighted at getting in the top 100 but your kind words have really made my day and motivated me to devote some more time to this art. thanks again.</td>', 'I am really taken back by all the lovely comments I have recieved, I was just delighted at getting in the top 100 but your kind words have really made my day and motivated me to devote some more time to this art. thanks again.', '2010-03-09 09:24:13.000000', NULL, 0),
(5896210, 856500, 9114, '<td valign="top">Very interesting and intriguing shot!<br/> <br/>Was the cup red or black? Red paper behind cup?  I''m trying to figure the light placement. I see one flash on the right side, but how did the light get on the other side of the mug? Bounce card? Any setup shots? This shot much have shot over $1,000 dollars worth of equip?<br/> <br/>Extremely well done and masterfully executed!<br/>Debbi</td>', 'Very interesting and intriguing shot! Was the cup red or black? Red paper behind cup?  I''m trying to figure the light placement. I see one flash on the right side, but how did the light get on the other side of the mug? Bounce card? Any setup shots? This shot much have shot over $1,000 dollars worth of equip? Extremely well done and masterfully executed!Debbi', '2010-03-09 09:50:06.000000', NULL, 0),
