(5896379, 857269, 59267, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by scooter97:</b></div><hr/><i> Great image. Nicely processed and presented. Congratulations on your result. The video is a nice addition too. I take it you are happy with the D7? </i></td></tr></table> <br/>Yes, if consider the features and performance per cost, 7D is the choice. I am happy with it.</td>', 'Originally posted by scooter97: Great image. Nicely processed and presented. Congratulations on your result. The video is a nice addition too. I take it you are happy with the D7?  Yes, if consider the features and performance per cost, 7D is the choice. I am happy with it.', '2010-03-09 11:27:50.000000', NULL, 0),
