(5912375, 856500, 103048, '<td valign="top">I have a last couple of questions if you don''t mind :-) (I''ve been trying to setup this shot in my basement and after spending a couple of hours, I need to clarify a few things):<br/> <br/>1. How big is that cup? <br/>2. How''re you getting the drops to be perfectly spherical / symmetrical and more importantly, so big! (I''ve been trying with water and the drops don''t seem to have a smooth spherical shape)?<br/> <br/>Thank you!<br/> <br/>Manav</td>', 'I have a last couple of questions if you don''t mind :-) (I''ve been trying to setup this shot in my basement and after spending a couple of hours, I need to clarify a few things): 1. How big is that cup? 2. How''re you getting the drops to be perfectly spherical / symmetrical and more importantly, so big! (I''ve been trying with water and the drops don''t seem to have a smooth spherical shape)? Thank you! Manav', '2010-03-21 23:44:27.000000', NULL, 0),
