(6133513, 854328, 96793, '<td valign="top">VERY underrated. the lines are so sharp but the motion/dynamics are captured so well at the same time. the perfectly sharp straight edges of the wall and road lines give an illusion of stability and safety while the car and mountains in the background bring in the chaos. i really like the desaturation of the blues in order to make the red of the fire pop.<br/> <br/></td>', 'VERY underrated. the lines are so sharp but the motion/dynamics are captured so well at the same time. the perfectly sharp straight edges of the wall and road lines give an illusion of stability and safety while the car and mountains in the background bring in the chaos. i really like the desaturation of the blues in order to make the red of the fire pop. ', '2010-08-18 02:12:56.000000', NULL, 0),
